<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Yes, but what about a toilet bowl, say, after a big night out the last thing you do before you pass out it you bring up a gallon of beer and that rancid kebab you should never have had. And in the morning it\'92s all there, drying and sticking \'85\'92\
